      "id": "claim_94a0d6be0c1a4e3bba57983d05c67f77",
      "statement": "Renovate's four channels rank by prPriority within the single Friday window: security (vulnerabilityAlerts + OSV) is schedule-exempt and unbudgeted on the nightly 0 3 * * * cron; lockFileMaintenance (pnpm, cargo-deps, python-deps) carries prPriority 5; docker base images carries prPriority 3; every other routine packageRule defaults to prPriority 0 — and every group sets automerge: false so nothing merges without review.",
