      "id": "claim_cbafc350ce384b609f6c1b3d75c5c485",
      "statement": "The weekly infra-image-scan CVE sweep is scheduled at 0 4 * * 5, three hours before renovate.yml's Friday window cron at 0 7 * * 5, deliberately, so that main's CVE posture is known before Renovate opens the PRs the sweep would otherwise need to gate retroactively; a guard test asserts the sweep cron stays strictly earlier than every Renovate window cron.",
