    {
      "id": "claim_fe90d1f441b24152bda0fd909268373a",
      "statement": "docker base images was raised to prPriority: 3 (item #486) because with prHourlyLimit: 4 and one in-window run a week, the three lockFileMaintenance channels at prPriority 5 already consume three of the four weekly PR slots by construction, previously starving docker base images (the channel carrying the same security-relevant base-image bumps the weekly CVE sweep blocks merges over) of a window slot for roughly six weeks; any later packageRules entry that takes over its groupName must explicitly reset prPriority to 0 or it silently inherits 3, and a guard test enforces this.",
